In this repository
==================

Data
----
- Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org/): the characters in core/src/main/resources/data/characters/wikidata/
  (names, Greek names, parents, descriptions, Wikidata items), written by importer/, and the coordinates of
  data/places.json. CC0 1.0: no attribution required; each record keeps its Wikidata item.
- Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/): the 1:10m land of frontend/public/map/land.json, clipped and
  simplified. Public domain. The map shows "Coastlines: Natural Earth".
- The Theoi Project (https://www.theoi.com/): the importer reads the titles of the pages Wikidata names, for a
  link's name ("Cronus (Kronos)"). Only links and those names are kept; no text of theirs.
- Wikipedia, Wikisource, Theoi, Mythologica, World History Encyclopedia, the Internet Classics Archive,
  LacusCurtius, YouTube: the catalog only links to their pages, which belong to their authors.

